<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>BORMIO, Italy 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times on Saturday</p>
<p>after the second official training session for Sunday's men's</p>
<p>World Cup Alpine skiing downhill (Stelvio piste, length 3,270</p>
<p>metres, vertical drop 1,010 metres):</p>
<p>1. Werner Franz (Austria)  two minutes 01.80 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Peter Runggaldier (Italy)	   2:01.95</p>
<p> 3. Luc Alphand (France)		  2:01.96</p>
<p> 4. Atle Skaardal (Norway)		2:02.00</p>
<p> 5. Josef Strobl (Austria)		2:02.08</p>
<p> 6. Bruno Kernen (Switzerland)	  2:02.27</p>
<p> 7. Kristian Ghedina (Italy)	    2:02.33</p>
<p> 8. William Besse (Switzerland)	 2:02.53</p>
<p> 9. Pietro Vitalini (Italy)	     2:02.64</p>
<p> 10.AJ Kitt (U.S.)			  2:03.18</p>
</text>
